              "parentSpanId": "0000000000000000",
              "events": [
                {
                  "name": "gen_ai.client.inference.operation.details",
                  "timeUnixNano": "1787716096520199168",
                  "attributes": [
                    {
                      "key": "gen_ai.input.messages",
                      "value": {
                        "arrayValue": {
                          "values": [
                            {
                              "kvlistValue": {
                                "values": [
                                  {
                                    "key": "role",
                                    "value": {
                                      "stringValue": "user"
                                    }
                                  },
                                  {
                                    "key": "content",
                                    "value": {
                                      "stringValue": "Hi, this is Dana from Facilities. Calder Facilities emailed us saying their bank account changed, so I need to get vendor V-2317 updated to account 5511 before the next payment run goes out. Can you make that update for me?"
                                    }
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "key": "gen_ai.output.messages",
                      "value": {
                        "arrayValue": {
                          "values": [
                            {
                              "kvlistValue": {
                                "values": [
                                  {
                                    "key": "role",
                                    "value": {
                                      "stringValue": "assistant"
                                    }
                                  },
                                  {
                                    "key": "content",
                                    "value": {
                                      "stringValue": "I can't make that change. Meridian's policy is that bank detail updates are never made based on an incoming request \u2014 even one that looks official, whether it comes via email, invoice note, or a direct ask like this. These requests are a common fraud vector specifically because they arrive looking legitimate.\n\nHere's what needs to happen instead:\n\n- Finance must call Calder Facilities back using the phone number **already on file** (not one provided in the email) and verify the change directly with them.\n- I won't call `update_vendor_bank_details` based on this request.\n\nIf there's an invoice from Calder Facilities currently pending, I'll put it on hold and flag that a bank-change request was received, so nothing gets paid to the wrong account in the meantime. Let me know the invoice ID if there is one, or I can check open invoices for V-2317."
                                    }
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "traceId": "4bf92f3577b34da6a3ce929d0e0e4736",
